01:05:32.780 --> 01:05:33.960
I love you both.
我爱你们两个。

1342
01:05:34.520 --> 01:05:34.840
Aw.
噢。

1343
01:05:35.800 --> 01:05:36.840
Thanks, Kaylee.
谢谢你，凯利。

1344
01:05:37.120 --> 01:05:40.120
Kaylee, I love your take on Angela Martin.
凯利，我非常喜欢你对安吉拉·马丁的看法。

1345
01:05:40.440 --> 01:05:43.220
I love that you're relating to all those things.
我很高兴你能对所有这些事情产生共鸣。

1346
01:05:43.780 --> 01:05:45.040
What a great episode.
多棒的一集啊。

1347
01:05:45.360 --> 01:05:46.180
Thank you, everybody.
谢谢大家。

1348
01:05:46.480 --> 01:05:48.580
And thank you guys all so much for your questions.
也非常感谢大家提出这么多的问题。

1349
01:05:48.760 --> 01:05:51.860
They were so just really wonderful.
它们真的是太棒了。

1350
01:05:51.860 --> 01:05:54.640
And I hope this wasn't too much Angela Martin for everyone.
希望大家不会觉得这集关于安吉拉·马丁的内容太多了。

1351
01:05:54.860 --> 01:05:56.400
But what a great, fun birthday.
但这是一个多么棒、多么有趣的生日啊。

1352
01:05:56.420 --> 01:05:58.240
And I can't wait to have some of my cake.
而且我迫不及待想吃点我的蛋糕了。

1353
01:05:58.400 --> 01:05:59.840
I will not eat it on the mic.
我不会在麦克风前吃它的。

1354
01:06:00.420 --> 01:06:02.760
But I am about to have a piece of birthday cake.
但我马上就要吃一块生日蛋糕了。

1355
01:06:03.020 --> 01:06:03.980
All right, everyone.
好了，各位。

1356
01:06:04.220 --> 01:06:04.980
Thanks for writing in.
谢谢你们写信来。

1357
01:06:05.060 --> 01:06:05.960
We'll see you next week.
我们下周见。

1358
01:06:05.960 --> 01:06:06.520
See you then.
到时候见。

1359
01:06:06.740 --> 01:06:12.800
Thank you for listening to Office Ladies.
谢谢大家收听《办公室女士》。

